{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Let her take.</b> Let what is in her hand be hers." "<b>Lest we become a laughingstock.</b> If you seek her further, the matter will become public and become a disgrace — for what have I further to do to verify my words?" "<b>See, I have sent this kid.</b> Because Judah deceived his father with a kid of the goats — he dipped Joseph's tunic in its blood — he too was deceived with a kid of the goats (Bereshit Rabbah)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:02:39.681712858Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}